WEBVTT

00:05:59.522 --> 00:06:03.401
Take, for instance, that notion
that for most of its history,

00:06:03.401 --> 00:06:08.739
the human species lived in tiny
egalitarian bands of hunter gatherers,

00:06:08.781 --> 00:06:14.328
until the advent of agriculture
ushered in a new age of inequality.

00:06:15.371 --> 00:06:21.335
Or the notion that with the arrival
of cities came social classes,

00:06:21.377 --> 00:06:28.092
sacred kings and rapacious oligarchs
trampling everyone else underfoot.

00:06:28.551 --> 00:06:31.095
From our very first history lessons,